    "summary": "Talos votes ABSTAIN under Agent T voting policy v1.0. This Info action is an SPO poll whose anchor excludes DRep votes from the mandate test, so Talos records participation without adding noise. Talos supports relieving small-pool economics (minPoolCost) before any k change."
